                                "sense_id": "d7a8e510-734d-3c91-b0c7-9be984a47c44",
                                "text": "Harvard's WHRB (FM 95.3) has everything from the punk-rocky “Record Hospital” at night to the country-ish “Hillbilly At Harvard” on Saturday mornings."
