                                "sense_id": "d7a8e510-734d-3c91-b0c7-9be984a47c44",
                                "text": "In “Beach Baby,” a countryish waltz, and “Babys,” a ballad with an itchy piano underlay, Mr. Vernon conjures thoughts of summertime from a distance."
